le, added KINES 321 to Semester 4 here (alongside BIOL 110, matching its real archived table position and satisfying its own real KINES 100 prereq from Semester 1). All other content mirrors the 2026 file's own schema and modeling choices unchanged (same generic 'Elective (graduate school prerequisite)' pool sourced from the department's current Supporting Courses page, same MATH 3/4/21/22 remedial chain fix for CHEM 110/106's real MATH 22 prereq -- this app's prereq catalog is shared/current across all catalog years, not year-scoped, so that fix applies here too -- and the same max_credits_per_semester=18 bump for the same reason).",
